      m_Calls: []
  m_text: When you're in the air, your directional inputs will let you <color=green>pefrom
    tricks and score points! </color>Use your <color=yellow>forward input </color>to
    perform a <color=green>flip </color>and your <color=yellow>backward input</color>
    to do a <color=green>back flip!</color> Use your <color=yellow>left and right
    inputs</color> to turn and perform a <color=green>360</color>. You can also score
    points by grinding <color=green>rails</color> and putting up <color=green>posters.</color>
    When on a <color=green>rail</color>, use your <color=yellow>left and right inputs
    </color>to balance so you don't fall off. <b>Try to utilize different tricks
    as much as you can to earn a higher score in the time limit!</b>
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
