  m_text: 'For keyboards:


    -On the ground, move Teddy using the <color=yellow>WASD
    and arrow keys. </color>Press the <color=yellow>up arrow or W key</color> to
    move forward. Press the <color=yellow>down arrow or the S key</color> to brake
    and move in reverse. Press the<color=yellow> left or right arrows</color> to
    steer Teddy in that direction. You can also use the <color=yellow>A key</color>
    to steer left or the <color=yellow>D key</color> to steer right.


    -Press
    the<color=yellow> Z key </color> to perform a jump.


    -Press the <color=yellow>X
    key</color> inside a glowing zone to put up a poster.'
