  m_text: 'For controllers:


    -On the ground, move Teddy using the <color=yellow>left
    joystick. Tilt forward </color>to move forward or <color=yellow>backward </color>to
    brake and move in reverse. <color=yellow>Tilt left or right </color>to steer
    Teddy in that direction.


    -Press the  <color=yellow>south button</color>
    to perform a jump.


    -Press the <color=yellow>east button</color> inside
    a glowing zone to put up a poster.'
